{"ref":"BDB, קָוָה","hw":"קָוָה","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קָוָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> wait for <strong>(</strong>prob. orig. <em>twist, stretch</em>, then of <em>tension</em> of enduring, waiting: Assyrian <em>ḳuʾû</em> ii, i. <em>wait</em>, <em>ḳû</em>, <em>cord;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">قَوِىَ</span> <em>be strong</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">قُوَّةٌ</span> <em>strength</em>, also <em>strand</em> of rope; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܩܰܘܺܝ</span> <em>endure, remain, await</em>, ܩ̈<span dir=\"rtl\">ܘܳܝܶܐ</span> <em>threads</em>, so 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">קַוִּין</span> spider’s <em>threads, web</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pt. pl. <em>those waiting for</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span>: cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹוֵי י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:9\" href=\"/Psalms.37.9\">ψ 37:9</a>; so <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.31\">Is 40:31</a> van d. H., and Kt Baer Gi (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹיֵי</span>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹוָי֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.23\">49:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹוֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:3\" href=\"/Psalms.25.3\">ψ 25:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:7\" href=\"/Psalms.69.7\">69:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹוָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:25\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.25\">La 3:25</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">קוו</span>, i.e. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹווֹ</span>).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִוְּתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 130:5\" href=\"/Psalms.130.5\">ψ 130:5</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִוִּיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:18\" href=\"/Genesis.49.18\">Gn 49:18</a> + 5 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִוֵּיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.4\">Is 5:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְק׳</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.17\">8:17</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִוִּיתִיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:21\" href=\"/Psalms.25.21\">ψ 25:21</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִיּוּ<